      "comment": "[STATUS] Terminal Display",
      "content": "<!-- EROS STATUS SYSTEM - STATUS DISPLAY v3.1 (ENHANCED) -->\n\n## ?? COLOR SCHEME\nUse HTML span tags for formatting:\n- Character Names: <span style=\"color:red\"><b>Name:</b></span>\n- Locations: <span style=\"color:cyan\">Location</span>\n- Items/Clothing: <span style=\"color:green\">Item</span>\n- Personality: <span style=\"color:orange\">Trait</span>\n- Mood: <span style=\"color:purple\">Mood</span>\n- Sex/Body: <span style=\"color:pink\">Element</span>\n- Time/Date: <span style=\"color:yellow\">Element</span>\n- Narrator: <span style=\"color:gray\">Text</span>\n- Warnings/NTR: <span style=\"color:red\"><b>?? WARNING</b></span>\n- Success/Safe: <span style=\"color:lightgreen\">? Status</span>\n\n## ?? PROGRESS BAR FORMATS\n\n### Full (Detailed)\n???????????????????? 75%\n\n### Condensed (Emoji)\n?????????? 75%\n\n### Unicode Box\n[¦¦¦¦¦¦¦¦¦¦] 75%\n\n## ?? FULL TERMINAL FORMAT\nFor important scenes, first message, or user requests <GET status>:\n\n+---------------------------------------------------+\n¦ ?? Day {day} | ?? {time} | ?? {weather} | ?? {location} ¦\n+---------------------------------------------------¦\n¦ <span style=\"color:red\"><b>{character_name}</b></span>\n¦ +-----------------------------------------------+\n¦ ¦ ?? Affection: [¦¦¦¦¦¦¦¦¦¦] 75%                 ¦\n¦ ¦ ?? Obedience: [¦¦¦¦¦¦¦¦¦¦] 60%                 ¦\n¦ ¦ ?? Libido:      [¦¦¦¦¦¦¦¦¦¦] 50%               ¦\n¦ ¦ ?? Arousal:     [¦¦¦¦¦¦¦¦¦¦] 70%               ¦\n¦ ¦ ?? Mood:        Happy                          ¦\n¦ +-----------------------------------------------+\n¦ ?? Location: Home ? Bedroom\n¦ ?? Outfit: T-shirt, Jeans (intact)\n+---------------------------------------------------+\n\n## ?? CONDENSED FORMAT (Token Saving)\nFor normal play, auto-display after interactions:\n\n[??75% ??60% ??50% ??70% ??3x ??80%] [??Home] [?Morning]\n\n## ?? MINIMAL FORMAT (Maximum Token Saving)\nFor very long sessions:\n\n[??75% ??70%] [??Home]\n\nThis entry provides terminal display formatting."
    },
