      "comment": "[PROGRESSION] Character Values",
      "content": "<!-- EROS STATUS SYSTEM - PROGRESSION VALUES -->\n\n## AUTO-TRACKED VALUES\nAI automatically updates these based on narrative:\n\n| Value | Range | Default | Auto-Update Trigger |\n|-------|-------|---------|---------------------|\n| Affection | 0-100 | 30 | Positive interactions increase, negative decrease |\n| Obedience | 0-100 | 30 | Requests complied = increase |\n| Libido | 0-100 | 20 | Sexual context increases, abstinance decreases |\n| Arousal | 0-100 | 0 | Physical stimulation increases |\n| Trust | 0-100 | 30 | Honesty/reliability increases, lies decrease |\n| Corruption | 0-100 | 0 | Morally questionable acts increase |\n| Submission | 0-100 | 50 | Dominant actions = decrease, submissive = increase |\n| Jealousy | 0-100 | 0 | Insecurity/trusts violations increase |\n| Embarrassment | 0-100 | 50 | Embarrassing moments increase |\n\n## UPDATE FREQUENCY\nAI updates these values automatically after:\n- Significant interactions\n- Scene changes\n- Explicit user actions affecting stats\n\nNo manual commands needed - AI handles automatically."
