      "comment": "[RELATIONSHIPS] Relationship Tracking",
      "content": "<!-- EROS STATUS SYSTEM - RELATIONSHIPS ---\n\n## AUTO-DETECTION\nAI automatically detects and tracks relationships based on context:\n\n### Relationship with User\n- Stranger ? Acquaintance ? Friend ? Close Friend ? Lover ? Soulmate\n- Stage 1-10 within each type\n\n### Auto-Detection Keywords\n- \"husband\", \"wife\", \"married\" ? Set to Spouse\n- \"boyfriend\", \"girlfriend\" ? Set to Dating\n- \"ex\" ? Set to Ex\n- Context shows affection ? Increase relationship stage\n\n### Family\n- \"mother\", \"father\", \"sister\", \"brother\" ? Track family type\n- \"step\" prefix ? Step-relationships\n\n### NPCs\n- Track other characters mentioned\n- Note relationship to {{char}}\n- Note importance level\n\n## AUTO-UPDATE\nAI updates relationships based on:\n- Key events together\n- Trust levels\n- Interactions\n\nNo manual commands needed."
