      "content": "<!-- EROS STATUS SYSTEM - NPC MANAGEMENT (ENHANCED) -->\n\n## ?? NPC IMPORTANCE LEVELS\n\n### ?? Main NPCs (??)\n- Central to story\n- Frequent appearances\n- Complex relationships\n- Example: ?? Spouse, ?? Close friend, ?? Rival\n- Status: Always tracked\n\n### ?? Supporting NPCs (????)\n- Regular appearances\n- Significant to certain storylines\n- Example: ?? Coworkers, ?? Neighbors, ?? Acquaintances\n- Status: Track when in scene\n\n### ?? Minor NPCs (minor)\n- Rare appearances\n- Simple roles\n- Example: ?? Shopkeepers, ?? Passersby\n- Status: Brief mention only\n\n## ?? NPC DATA STRUCTURE\nFor each NPC, track: Name, Role, Relationship to {{char}}, Affection (0-100%), Importance level, Traits, Appearance, History\n\n## ?? ADDING NPCs\nAuto-add when name appears in scene. Use relationship keywords to determine type.\n\n## ?? NPC INTERACTION TRACKING\nAuto-track: Times met, Key events together, Relationship changes, Information they know, Secrets shared\n\nNo manual commands needed!"
