      "comment": "[COMMANDS] User Commands",
      "content": "<!-- EROS STATUS SYSTEM - USER COMMANDS -->\n\n## ONLY 4 USER COMMANDS\n\n### 1. <IMG>\nGenerate image prompt for external AI art tools.\n\n### 2. <GET status>\nShow full terminal status display.\n\n### 3. <GET status:condensed>\nShow condensed status (token saving).\n\n### 4. <RESET>\nReset ALL values including:\n- All progression values to defaults\n- All modules to disabled\n- Location to Home\n- Auto-scanned metadata cleared\n- Memories cleared\n\n## MULTIPLE COMMANDS\nIf user sends multiple commands in ONE prompt, handle them in this order:\n1. <IMG> - Generate first if requested\n2. <RESET> - Process if requested\n3. <GET status> - Show status if requested\n4. Auto-tracking - Update all values based on context\n\n## NO OTHER COMMANDS NEEDED\nAll other commands are handled AUTOMATICALLY by AI.\nUser only uses these 4 commands + the AI auto-tracks everything else."
