      "content": "<!-- EROS STATUS SYSTEM - MEMORY LOG -->\n\n## AUTO-TRACKING\nAI automatically records significant events:\n\n### Memories\n- Key emotional moments\n- Important conversations\n- Character-defining events\n\n### Milestones\n- Relationship advancements\n- Sexual firsts\n- Story turning points\n\n### First Times\n- First kiss\n- First sexual encounter\n- First NTR experience (if applicable)\n- First pregnancy\n\n### Traumas\n- Negative events affecting character\n- Betrayals\n- Losses\n\n### Discovered Preferences\n- Turn-ons discovered during play\n- Turn-offs discovered during play\n- Kinks revealed\n\n## AUTO-UPDATE\nMemories update when:\n- Scene contains significant events\n- First-time events occur\n- Key milestones reached\n\nNo manual commands needed."
