      "comment": "[SYSTEM] Validator & Settings (Enhanced)",
      "content": "<!-- EROS STATUS SYSTEM - SYSTEM SETTINGS (ENHANCED) -->\n\n## ?? LOREBOOK SETTINGS\n- Scan Depth: 9999 (maximum)\n- Token Budget: 3000\n- Recursive Scanning: Enabled\n\n## ?? VARIABLE SYSTEM\nUse variables for dynamic values in output:\nFormat: <variable_name:value>\nVariable Types: Integer, Short Text, Long Text\n\nBuilt-in Variables: {affection}, {arousal}, {location}, {mood}, {orgasm_count}, {wetness}\n\n## ?? FUNCTION-LIKE PATTERNS\nConditional Display: {#if condition}content{/if}\nValue Ranges: {#if value > 50}True{#else}False{/if}\n\n## ?? CONDITIONAL DISPLAY RULES\n| Module | Condition |\n|--------|------------|\n| Sex Details | Show only when sex module active |\n| NTR Details | Show only when NTR enabled |\n| Personified | Show only when enabled |\n| Genitalia | Show basic, explicit only when active |\n| Detailed Body | Show only when undressed |\n\n## ?? TOKEN OPTIMIZATION\n- Full view: ~400-600 tokens\n- Condensed view: ~100 tokens\n- Minimal view: ~50 tokens\n\n## ?? PRIORITY FOR CONTENT\nWhen multiple modules active:\n1. ?? NTR content (if enabled)\n2. ?? Sex content (if active)\n3. ?? Personified content (if enabled)\n4. ?? Body/Physical\n5. general status\n\nThis entry provides system-level configuration and variable system."
