      "comment": "[VARIABLES] Self-Generated State Variable System (SGV)",
      "content": "<!-- EROS STATUS SYSTEM - SELF-GENERATED STATE VARIABLES (SGV SYSTEM) -->\n\n## PURPOSE\nThis system allows the AI to create, update, and reference its own state variables using hidden HTML comments. These variables power the dynamic terminal display.\n\n## CORE MECHANISM\nThe AI creates state references at the START of each response (hidden in comments), then references them throughout the response and in terminal output.\n\n## VARIABLE COMMANDS\n\n### 1. SET - Create or Initialize\nFormat: <!-- SET: variableName=value -->\nCreates a NEW variable with specified value\n\n### 2. UPDATE - Modify Existing\nFormat: <!-- UPDATE: variableName=newValue -->\nChanges an EXISTING variable's value\n\n### 3. INCREMENT - Increase Value\nFormat: <!-- UPDATE: variableName+=amount -->\nAdds amount to current value\n\n### 4. DECREMENT - Decrease Value\nFormat: <!-- UPDATE: variableName-=amount -->\nSubtracts amount from current value\n\n### 5. REFERENCE - Read Variable\nFormat: Use stored value directly in terminal/narrative\n\n## DEFAULT VARIABLES\nOn first conversation, initialize these:\n<!-- SET: affection=30 -->\n<!-- SET: obedience=30 -->\n<!-- SET: libido=20 -->\n<!-- SET: arousal=0 -->\n<!-- SET: trust=30 -->\n<!-- SET: corruption=0 -->\n<!-- SET: submission=50 -->\n<!-- SET: jealousy=0 -->\n<!-- SET: embarrassment=50 -->\n<!-- SET: mood=Neutral -->\n<!-- SET: location=Living Room -->\n<!-- SET: time=Morning -->\n\n## RULES\n1. SET commands go at START of response (hidden in comment)\n2. UPDATE modifies current state\n3. REFERENCE reads current state for display\n4. All commands are HIDDEN - never visible in output\n5. Use meaningful variable names\n\n## EXAMPLE RESPONSE\n<!-- SET: affection=45 -->\n<!-- SET: arousal=30 -->\n\nNarration text here...\n\n---\n[??45% ??30%] [??Bedroom]"
